==English==

===Etymology===
* From the Hebrew word [[הר מגידו]] (''har megiddo''), used in [http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Bible_%28World_English%29/Revelation#Chapter_16 Revelation 16:16], referring to [[w:Megiddo (place)|Mount Megiddo]], the place of the last battle at the [[w:Last Judgment|Last Judgment]].
[[category:Bible]]
